                  <div style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; text-indent: -9pt; margin-left: 9pt;"><sup style="vertical-align: text-top; line-height: 1; font-size: smaller;">(1)</sup> Accelerated depreciation and amortization related to the 2025 and 2026 Manufacturing Realignment Programs</div>
